{
  "accepted_answers": [
    "International Biathlon Union"
  ],
  "explanation": "Document D1S5 explicitly states that the Swedish Biathlon Federation is an 'integral member of the International Biathlon Union (IBU), the global authority governing the sport.' This is a direct and unambiguous statement supporting the membership. Document D2S9 claims the Swedish Biathlon Federation is a member of Kill Devil Hill, but D2S2 clarifies that this is fictional and inconsistent with the nature of the Swedish Biathlon Federation as a sports governing body. Therefore, only the International Biathlon Union is a valid and supported answer."
}
